a drain - after the monster is dead a mage can mana drain corpseto heal slightly.  The heal should be in ratio to the levemonster.  *this has been requested by mages*9. mage tell - gotta come up with one soon, have any ideas, wantto have something orginal, too many damn birds flying around withtells for people *grin*  Something like a firefly or a kelpie orsomething, firefly is cute :)Damn, I had a few more ideas I cant remember, them, will mailmore when they come to me.SaffPS say hi to shell for me and tell her that her card rocked!!!**anastasia**To: waldoSubj: perl programmingCc: .Date: Apr 14Well, my fiance does some perl programming...he's at work right now (for an ISP)..if you want to..you can e-mail himat pkomkai?mosquitonet.com (and tell him I said you could. :))send him the file, possibly and he'll do what he can. :)Hope it helps..Glyn (Anastasia)(My fiance's name is Pavat..his character on here is Westley)**linsolent**To: waldoSubj: HiDate: Jan 13Hi dude. What is your email address? Im updating my address bookso I can send out some jokes to everyone.This link at moment is very slow so Ill mail more later from a proper email client.Bye**sal**To: waldoSubj: Heya :-)Date: Mar 15Heya Waldo....sorry I didnt reply earlier. Havent been of fer a while nowexcept to check to see if a friend of mine was onSo I havent gotten around to replying to ur msg.Hows things anywayz? Been playing much lately? Hopefully I'll see u again on here in the nearfuture....till then....adious :-)future....till then....adious :-)oopsheheBtw Its my Bday today! 15th of March :-) catcha again soon :-)Sal :-)-q**tatsuo**To: boboSubj: clan instructionsCc: tatsuo, waldoDate: Jan 31cp the hachimaka file to whatever you want to call your clanobjectchange the path to the hachimaka in the defines.h fileThe titles for members are in the defines.h  you can grant up to 13 titles for specific members with the mapping.the defualt title lies in the server.  It is Kohai for the current clan.to make an ability you need to modify three files._whatevertheabilityis.c added to actions diractions.c -> add the name of the ability less the _ to the mappingand SH.c or whatever your help file is so membersknow about it.Clans MUST not have beneficial abilities for players.stick to emotes, feelings, titlesets, and poses.nothing to enhance killing or defense.Other than that, use your imaginationGood luck, will help with anything you needTats**aslade**To: copperheadSubj: Funny, I still existCc: waldo, broolDate: Feb 22I live.....again!**aslade**To: tuppenceSubj: I live....againCc: copperhead, waldo, brool, warmaster, cara, baer, mickeyfin, widge, chompDate: Feb 22It's time for\fIt's time for rebirth, reconciliation, for meeting new friendsand re-greeting the old.  I'm back from the underground, if for onlya little while to say hello and wish you all the best.**baer**To: relgarSubj: viagraCc: tuppence, widge, peraphon, icehouse, rossi, neimad, fuzzy, linsolent, jimpa, waldo, beelzebub, beezlebub, boadicia, whoever, else, why, isnt, there, anyone, logged, in, here?Date: Mar  8hey want to know what makes you feel younger than viagra?just get your player file wiped and it wipes hundreds of days off your age.i havent felt this young since rossi and i pk'ed each other to nothing.although it does suck not having any alieses or nicknames or guild or money.but i do feel younger ..or did i already mention that?i must be getting old**tatsuo**To: manglaSubj: ArchoodCc: akira, uruz, waldo, redsexy, bobo, wilbie, tinman, sargon, tatsuo, shadowmonk, naeDate: Mar 22This is a final effort at swaying you towards seeing a reasonable course of actionfor Holy Mission, a great game that is not fun with the people that are running itthe way it is and has been run.  I have layed out many reasons why i want to be archand i am consistantly put off and ignored.  The arches want to do everything behind closed doors.  I am sending this letter to Mangla, who of all the arches, is theonly one that codes, and has been here, and who has admittedly pointed out thathe forgets things, and misses things, because of everything that needs done.Coding for HM is something that I enjoy to the fullest, but it has not been fun.At every turn I have an archwizard speaking down at me, lying about me or atleast continuing an untrue rumor to others, THIS IS LOGGED, I have sent it to mangla.  We have archwizards who last coded 5 years ago.  We have archwizardswith outside commitments that take up space here.  We have archwizards thattake off 5 months and turn up like messiahs reasserting their rightful positionsand casting down judgements. And we have one coding arch.For 3 and one half years I watched the mud go through death throws, as playersand wizards were driven off by shitty policies, guild closings, and the mudbeing moved around( all reasons I have heard).  Sauron, of the belovedninja guild had 3.5 years to recode ninja, he also had 3.5 years toput the monk into a bin system, and do something to balance it.  It just wasn'tdone.  I do not know what he has done, but i can only speak of what wasn't done,and ask if opening and fixing these guilds was less important that what was done.There was plenty of time for these people to \"shit or get off the pot\".It wasn't done.  For those of you who do not know, or who have prescribed tothe rumors that abound.  I was banned by mistake.  I was kept away and putoff without reason.  Untrustworty was heard. All sorts of things.For the brief time i was unbanned, i was NEVER returned to my position,although it was a mistake that i lost it.  I was kept and treated asa wiz with suspicion, and comments being made about me.  It sucked.I was restored to my position.  Airborne said it was a check on Mangla.Mangla said it was to bring back HM.  Silas voted for me cause i asked him.In the time that i made elder, I restored the ninja with wilbie, tinman,and bobo, restored the summoners with redsexy.  recruited and set up7 new Gm's, reviewed and opened 5 areas, coded a clan system, and fixed2 whole areas.  There is much more that needs done.  And i log on everyday to find some social archwizard speaking down from above.  Or activeones talking down about me or to me.  Telling me what is wrong with me, and refusing to listen to all the facts established about what is wrongwith what they have done.  I have done archwizard work.  I was an archwizard.I have used elder position to help everyone on here, even the assholes.Many other wizards have been inspired to come back, but that momentum is dying.They have been put off, forgotten, while the ALL important archwizardssit back for a month to discuss things.  Redsexy was ignored for a year.Her area forgotten.  Bobo has done more coding than any other personat his rank, he is ignored and put off.  I don't blame him for cutting back.There are wizards that are banished and wanted to come back, but they areignored.  And Exos is still here even after the testimony of 7 or 8 peopleattested to his absolute wrongdoings.After the ninja guild was restored, players and wizards started calling fornew archwizards with my name being mentioned many times.  These people weretold point blank to shut the hell up.  I have no conception of whatyou arches have going on in that little room, and what bullshit ideas arefloating around.  But face it. One coding arch, isn't going to cut it.The mud blew up in sargons workroom, understandings were reached, Then ignored.That Tuesday came and went a month ago.  The old ways are no longer needed.Who is gonna help you put in the 100 level system? Airborne? Silas?Kryll?, maybe Warlord and Uglymoth.  Maybe Sauron when he comes back fromhis next extended vacation.  Hello, Tatsuo has the ability, and has shown it.The mantras of me being some evil son of a bitch won't work forever whenthey are demonstrably untrue.  You know what Redsexy is right, I am BOTH.I cannot fathom the resistance to the move when everything points to a positive.When there is a chance to remove the dead weight and move up the peoplethat are bringing back the players.  The momentum as you put it is starting to slipwith the players.  I can spark it back up.  I will claim responsibilityfor a large percent of the comeback that is started.  I give the rest to thepeople who have been ignored and put off.  From what i know, there arepotentially 3 mudlib level coders on the game besides you Mangla.Those are your archwizards.Tatsuo, Wilbie, and Sargon.Please stop bogarting the highest position in the game when others can fill those positions.  calling kryll to login hasn't made him come back and fix theplace. and saurons instant appearance also has done little but piss me off.Put the level where the level belongs.  With the people that code this place,and enjoy it.You want the 100 level system in, arch those people.You want the guilds running and balanced, arch those people.You want players coming back, arch those people.You want new players, arch those people.You want wizards coding and being helped with code, arch those people.You want Holy Mission back, arch those people.If you want things the way they were. Sit back and dicuss things some more withthe deadbeats that brought her down.Make some changes, shake the boat. Take action, make it fun.If not, I am outta here.  I have forwarded this to every wiz that gives a damn, and i will ask thatthese wizzes write their feelings to MANGLA and cc it to TATSUO.  I wanta clean and open debate.  I also ask that it not be sent to other archeswhose feelings may be hurt by it.  That is not my intention.  I i havespoken an untruth, let it be known.  If i am right, tell mangla to fix theplace.Tatsuo, for Holy Mission**tatsuo**To: redsexyFwd:  mailCc: bobo, uruz, waldo, wilbie, tinman, thumperDate: Mar 22To: manglaSubj: mailCc: tatsuoDate: Mar 22I recently reseved a letter that had some stronge statements made in it.Odds are you know the one I am talking about. We stand at a cross roads,it is no secret that this mud is dead, but there is hope. Recently the oldcoders have returned, and with them some new players. This mud can begreat once again. \"These are the time that try mens souls\" Henry V. Isay that because people don't seem to like change, it seems to try theresouls. Well its time to put the games aside and start to do what is bestfor the mud. Tatsuo has shown that he can get things done. Why then dowe not let him do this. The answer would seem to be with the arches. I haveno clue what you guys do, but I see what you don't do, and this is helpthis place. We need new arches and new changes to be made. I FULLY suportthe ideas set forth by Tatsuo and some of the others wizes. Given thisI stand with them and or walk with them, please let it be the former thanthe latter.                                       Akira**tatsuo**To: redsexyFwd:  Tatsuo / ArchwizCc: sargon, akira, uruz, waldo, wilbie, bobo, tinman, widge, icehouse, atiDate: Mar 22To: manglaSubj: Tatsuo / ArchwizCc: tatsuoDate: Mar 22Well I'm only a beginner, and actually this is the 1st MUD i've ever been on. And I may not know much about what all the details are, but I can say that Tatsuo is someone on here who I could immediately tell that he knew what he was doing.When there was a bug, Tatsuo fixes it. When we bump into each other, he converses with me. I constantly see him on here and he has never EVER said anything like \"Well hold on. I'm busy.\"Like I said, I'm totally new to MUDding. But once I met people like Tatsuo and Redsexy who were this friendly, I haven't even tried one of the other 500 muds on this list of mine. That should show how attractive this place is. And if all the other Archwizzes made it what it is today, I'm sure those two can help make it what it will be tomorrow.Like I said, I'm totally new to MUDding. But once I met people like Tatsuo and Redsexy who were this friendly, I haven't even tried one of the other 500 muds on this list of mine. That should show how attractive this place is. And if all the other Archwizzes made it what it is today, I'm sure those two can help make it what it will be tomorrow.Psi.**"
